description:
Saturday October 24 in San Francisco, calling all freaks! It’s going to be a steamy one with Dino Soccio returning to the party.
Dino Soccio has emerged as one of Los Angeles’ premier underground selectors and producers. Renowned for his meticulous disco reworks, his tracks have found a home on leading imprints like Razor N Tape, Mute Records, and his own highly sought-after labels, Pleasure of Love & New Islands. Whether anchoring Hollywood residency or steering global sets from Mexico City to London, Soccio serves up an elevated mix of interstellar disco, obscure global dance cuts and international underground jammers.
Costumes welcomed.
Early arrival recommended.
Be yourself. Dress to dance.
